zsh4humans patch for zsh-syntax-highlighting, applied by fn/-z4h-postinstall-zsh-syntax-highlighting.

Base: zsh-users/zsh-syntax-highlighting e6683f20e5c38d3e5447f45845d04ddda75d0f23, the commit pinned
in fn/-z4h-install-one. The patch carries romkatv's performance work from the
zsh4humans/zsh-syntax-highlighting fork (branch z4h-stable) rebased onto that commit: integer flags
and a path cache in the main highlighter, a minimal driver that z4h calls directly, and tests for
these changes. AGENTS.md explains how to regenerate it.

